[API] below $50: validateCoupon returns false and NO addCoupon is sent — the discount stays $0.00 and the cart total is unchanged (live-verified on theme 2.55.0-pr-2417, 2026-08-06) {OBSERVED}
[DOM] below $50 the Custom code card shows the "This code is not valid" error (red icon + text) auto-clearing after COUPON_ERROR_TIMEOUT=7000ms — capture it immediately; the former VCST-5518 / PR #2422 build gate is RESOLVED (deployed theme is >= 2.55.0-pr-2422), so the error UI is the single expected behaviour and a dashed border with no error text is a FAIL, not a build variance {SPEC}
[DOM] below $50: the Discount row in order summary remains at $0.00 — it is always rendered, it is not absent {OBSERVED}
[DOM] at/above $50: the Custom code card transitions to a solid green border, green check icon, and 'Remove coupon' trash icon {OBSERVED}
[MATH] at/above $50: discount = 10% of the subtotal (e.g. subtotal $59.96 → discount −$6.00); order total = subtotal − discount + shipping + tax, tax computed on the discounted base (e.g. 59.96 − 6.00 + 0.00 + 10.79 = 64.75), per BL-CHK-006 {OBSERVED}

